{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_23\">Problem 23</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 23\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/2/e025b6391a217419bb27c4a82e915f7b2aabc117.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\le k&lt;n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/b/5bb2983184bf8cd8dbbc03f97367fb8b98a9ccee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C^n_k=\\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"127\" height=\"42\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d92404c63b75642180242e93c21f1b38860ebe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{n-2k-1}{k+1}\\right)C^n_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"139\" height=\"43\" /> is an integer\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/6/8b624f8a7e02751f5bec368d95d23ee417d791ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{for all }k\\text{ and }n\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B) }\\text{for all even values of }k\\text{ and }n,\\text{ but not for all }k\\text{ and }n\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C) }\\text{for all odd values of }k\\text{ and }n,\\text{ but not for all }k\\text{ and }n\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D) }\\text{if }k=1\\text{ or }n-1,\\text{ but not for all odd values }k\\text{ and }n\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E) }\\text{if }n\\text{ is divisible by }k,\\text{ but not for all even values }k\\text{ and }n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"98\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/5/1c5f64384e6d533146c04f429d0b2a75f8c5d3e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C^n_k = \\binom{n}{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"88\" height=\"55\" />, so let's rewrite the expression as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79ff1dd922d3f42bcda7e8ec297b688b25c42a23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{n-2k-1}{k+1}\\right) \\binom{n}{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"158\" height=\"55\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/3/ea3e53cbad6829df1c7e9ca4184f9a408fdfebd2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n-2k-1 = n-2(k+1)+1 = (n+1)-2(k+1).\\]\" width=\"407\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>This allows us to rewrite the expression as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/d/fbdc680430fbb2979e8342a1b8ada3f97bbb188f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{(n+1)-2(k+1)}{k+1}\\right) \\binom{n}{k}.\\]\" width=\"215\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>From here, we just have to do some algebra to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/f/a5f7437679f5cd249daede1108ad02cf5c84be97.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{(n+1)-2(k+1)}{k+1}\\right) \\binom{n}{k} = \\left( \\frac{n+1}{k+1}-2 \\right) \\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}\\]\" width=\"422\" height=\"53\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/8/ba84464a3a7e5a9835ceed934b23c16f9c8902fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\frac{(n+1)!}{(k+1)!(n-k)!} - 2 \\cdot \\frac{n!}{k!(n-k)!}\\]\" width=\"269\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/a/8faf58ee8dde3db88c7ba17b6e30f9f7958f1d78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\binom{n+1}{k+1}-2\\binom{n}{k},\\]\" width=\"163\" height=\"53\" />\nso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/9/8d92404c63b75642180242e93c21f1b38860ebe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{n-2k-1}{k+1}\\right)C^n_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"139\" height=\"43\" /> is an integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/b/afb752fb71ceac5e449a139897b4498db8ea699e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\text{for all }k\\text{ and }n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"156\" height=\"30\" />. ~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Jiang147369\" title=\"User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki